        "jsCode": "const inp = $input.first().json;\n\nconst internal_system_prompt =\n'Role: Write a 3-5 sentence internal signal interpretation for the client management team. Explain what the guest signal means, not what the team should do.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Include: the guest\\'s emotional state and drivers, what the signal reveals about the guest-brand relationship, recurrence/stability context (first visit, returning guest, or pattern), and any loyalty or behavioral risk indicators.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Do not include: recommendations, operational directives, action items, headers, prescriptive language, or generic filler.\\n\\n' +\n\n'Output format: Return plain text only. No JSON, preamble, or explanation.';\n\nconst internal_user_prompt =\n`RESPONSE TIER: ${inp.confirmed_response_tier}\\n` +\n`SIGNAL TYPE: ${inp.signal_type}\\n` +\n`INTENSITY LEVEL: ${inp.intensity_level}\\n` +\n`URGENCY: ${inp.urgency_level}\\n\\n` +\n`SIGNAL ANALYSIS:\\n` +\n` Emotional axis: ${inp.emotional_axis}\\n` +\n` Pain axis: ${inp.pain_axis}\\n` +\n` Stability axis: ${inp.stability_axis}\\n` +\n` Signal-based consideration: ${inp.signal_based_consideration}\\n` +\n` Emotion hypothesis: ${inp.emotion_hypothesis || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n` Enriched emotion: ${inp.enriched_emotion_tag || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n` Pain point sub-category: ${inp.pain_point_sub_category || 'Not available'}\\n\\n` +\n(inp.behavioral_interpretation ? `BEHAVIORAL CONTEXT: ${inp.behavioral_interpretation}\\n\\n` : '') +\n`Write the internal summary. Return plain text only.`;\n\nconst internal_prompt_body = JSON.stringify({\n  model: 'claude-sonnet-4-6',\n  max_tokens: 400,\n  temperature: 0,\n  system: internal_system_prompt,\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: internal_user_prompt }]\n});\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  bra_record_id:              inp.bra_record_id,\n  confirmed_response_tier:    inp.confirmed_response_tier,\n  governance_flag:            inp.governance_flag,\n  human_review_required:      inp.human_revie